loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Responses were weighted to represent all live births in Massachusetts\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Weighted to adjust for complex survey design and nonresponse.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"the midpoint of each range was used to approximate household income.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Those with missing information on seasonal or pH1N1 vaccination (n = 42) were excluded from the analysis.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}